# 23. TESTING AND ACCEPTANCE CHECKLIST

## Layout

- Header and search are correctly aligned.
- Quick filters appear in the right order.
- Promotional banner has correct proportions.
- Recently Viewed Cars and Continue Your Journey appear in the correct order.
- Recommended For You contains multiple rows.
- Featured Cars has Popular, Just Launched, and Upcoming tabs.
- Featured cards include View Price Breakdown.
- Explore by Brand includes the grid and View All Brands.
- Popular Filters includes Body Type, Budget, and Fuel Type.
- Filtered car list and View All action are present.
- Price disclaimers appear in the appropriate locations.
- Compare Cars and More Comparisons are present.
- Latest Car Updates has three tabs.
- News/media cards and More News are present.

## Functionality

- Search uses existing logic.
- Filters update content when supported.
- Car cards use existing details routes.
- Brand selection uses existing catalog navigation.
- Comparison previews open the existing Compare flow.
- News previews use existing article and media data.
- Read More opens a valid destination.
- More News opens the existing News page.
- Bottom navigation remains functional.
- No duplicate comparison engine or news feed is introduced.

## Quality

- Ethiopian-market content and ETB pricing are used where available.
- Sample data and missing integrations are clearly documented.
- Existing correct code has been preserved.
- Unnecessary code has been removed only after verification.
- No new overflow or runtime errors have been introduced.
- Flutter analysis has been run.
- Relevant tests have been run.
- Pre-existing errors are distinguished from new errors.

