# 24. DEFINITION OF DONE

The New Cars home page is ready when every required section is implemented in the specified order, the layout and scrolling have been checked on an Android device or emulator, existing navigation and shared functionality work correctly, and all remaining limitations are documented.

The implementation report must list:

- Files inspected.
- Files modified or created.
- Code preserved.
- Bugs fixed.
- Redundant code removed and why.
- Analysis and test results.
- Missing integrations and remaining issues.

Do not claim completion until the implementation and verification have actually been performed.

This is the consolidated master specification. Use it as the source of truth for your New Cars agent, then implement it one stage at a time in OpenCode.